# iterative thinking — a refused proposal is followed, in the same thinking, by another try
#
# Medium doubt (--doubt medium) gives one retry, and the doubt while it remains: answered YES.
# The goal draw is pinned to examine and the first means to Knack, which the coded willingness rule
# refuses ("I want to act, not to stand and observe"). With a retry left the same mind thinks again:
# examine comes back at once, since other means are able to carry it out, and it is carried out by
# one of those — Butchery, at seed 42 — which is not asked whether it would rather not. One thinking,
# one button.
# Without the retry (--doubt low, see thinking_refused_goal_per_mind.cli) the thinking ends on the
# refusal and it is the next thinking that reaches examine.
#
# --means-only knack cannot hold on the retry, whose pool has Knack crossed off; that miss is the
# point, hence allow-flag-miss.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Crown" --period dawn --observe-only "Test Giant Tree" --grant-mm knack,woodcraft,scientific_research --means-only knack --doubt medium

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal examine
advance 12 180

# Think with Ripelore: Knack refuses, the mind acknowledges it and tries again, and the retry
# reaches the button.
click observe "Test Giant Tree"
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
click think "Test Giant Tree"
choose ripelore
advance 12 180
expect-state texts "I want to act, not to stand and"
expect-state texts "That will not do, and I think again"
expect-state texts "another way"
expect-state texts "] examine the test giant tree closely"
# Medium doubts too: the reasoning ends on a question, answered YES (nothing queued), which spends
# no try — the refusal after it spends the one.
expect-state texts "But is it truly wise"
expect-state texts "I am resolved to"

allow-flag-miss --goal-only
allow-flag-miss --means-only
quit
